  "steps": [
    "Cut potatoes into small cubes. Toss with 4g oil, garlic powder, smoked paprika, onion powder, cayenne and salt.",
    "Air-fry potatoes at 200\u00b0C / 400\u00b0F for 20\u201325 minutes, shaking halfway.",
    "Rub chicken with 2g oil, salt and black pepper. Add to air fryer with potatoes in the last 15 minutes.",
    "Chicken is done when internal temp reaches 72\u00b0C / 160\u00b0F."
